12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the principles and syntax of SystemVerilog Assertions \(SVA\), differentiating immediate vs concurrent assertions, sequences, properties, and their role in formal and dynamic verification.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Motivation for SystemVerilog Assertions:) Tj
T*
(   - In complex digital systems, a hardware defect may manifest deep within an internal state) Tj
T*
(   machine, but its visible symptom \(corrupted output data\) might not emerge until thousands of) Tj
T*
(   clock cycles later, making root-cause debugging agonizingly difficult.) Tj
T*
(   - SystemVerilog Assertions \(SVA\) specify formal temporal rules that internal signals must) Tj
T*
(   satisfy continuously. If a rule is violated, an assertion fires immediately at the exact clock) Tj
T*
(   cycle and pin location of the fault.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Immediate vs Concurrent Assertions:) Tj
T*
(   - Immediate Assertions: Evaluated instantaneously based on current signal values during) Tj
T*
(   procedural code execution, exactly like a software if-statement: always_comb begin assert \(sel) Tj
T*
(   < 4\) else $error\("Illegal mux select"\); end. They do not depend on clock edges.) Tj
T*
(   - Concurrent Assertions: Evaluated over temporal spans of time synchronized to clock) Tj
T*
(   transitions. They capture sampled signal values in the Preponed region of the simulation clock) Tj
T*
(   cycle, preventing simulation race conditions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Structural Building Blocks of SVA: Sequences and Properties:) Tj
T*
(   - Boolean Expressions: The fundamental condition \(e.g. req == 1\).) Tj
T*
(   - Sequences: Model linear temporal relationships over multiple clock cycles using cycle-delay) Tj
T*
(   operators \(##n\):) Tj
T*
(   sequence s_handshake;) Tj
T*
(   req ##[1:2] ack;) Tj
T*
(   endsequence) Tj
T*
(   - Properties: Combine sequences using logical and implication operators to model complete) Tj
T*
(   protocol behavior:) Tj
T*
(   property p_bus_grant;) Tj
T*
(   @\(posedge clk\) disable iff \(!reset_n\)) Tj
T*
(   req |=> ##[1:3] grant ##1 busy;) Tj
T*
