T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Statement Selection and Deconstruction:) Tj
T*
(   - Selecting Problem Statements with Measurable Technical Gaps: Avoid generic software app) Tj
T*
(   statements; choose government ministry or industrial hardware problem statements having) Tj
T*
(   quantifiable pain points \(e.g., smart agricultural telemetry, railway track acoustic crack) Tj
T*
(   detection, portable biomedical analyzers\).) Tj
T*
(   - Functional Decomposition: Break the challenge down into: \(1\) Transducer/Sensor Tier, \(2\) Edge) Tj
T*
(   Processing & Control Tier, \(3\) Power Supply & Thermal Architecture, \(4\) Connectivity Tier, and) Tj
T*
(   \(5\) User Visualization Dashboard.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Rapid Hardware Engineering Execution \(The 72-Hour Sprint\):) Tj
T*
(   - The Modular-to-Custom Bridge: Start immediately on Day 1 by validating individual sensor) Tj
T*
(   readouts using modular development breakout boards. Concurrently, design a custom 2-layer or) Tj
T*
(   4-layer PCB in KiCad. Fabricate the board on-site using rapid CNC isolation milling or fast) Tj
T*
(   chemical etching, and hand-solder surface-mount components.) Tj
T*
(   - Rugged Industrial Enclosure: Design a custom CAD enclosure in Fusion 360 and 3D print it) Tj
T*
(   immediately. Evaluators dismiss messy, fragile breadboards with rat's-nest jumper wires; a) Tj
T*
(   neat, fully enclosed, battery-powered product with labeled connectors conveys professional) Tj
T*
(   engineering readiness.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Live Demonstration Strategy Under Hostile Conditions:) Tj
T*
(   - Autonomous Offline Fallback: Venue Wi-Fi in massive hackathon arenas inevitably crashes due) Tj
T*
(   to thousands of competing devices. An engineering prototype that relies entirely on cloud) Tj
T*
(   internet for basic operation will fail. Systems must incorporate an offline local fallback mode) Tj
T*
(   \(e.g. local OLED display, Bluetooth BLE, or local SD card logging\).) Tj
T*
(   - Quantified Performance Metrics: Deliver empirical, measured performance metrics during the) Tj
T*
(   jury evaluation: latency \(e.g. 12 ms response time\), measurement accuracy \(<1% error compared) Tj
T*
(   to commercial meter\), power consumption \(operates for 72 hours on a 2500 mAh battery\), and) Tj
T*
(   estimated bill-of-materials cost \(BOM < INR 1,500 compared to INR 25,000 commercial equipment\).) Tj
