(   benchmark standards governing printed circuit board design, fabrication, and assembly \(e.g.) Tj
T*
(   IPC-2221 generic design, IPC-2222 rigid boards, IPC-A-610 electronic assembly acceptability\).) Tj
T*
(   - The IPC Certified Interconnect Designer \(CID\) certification proves that an engineer possesses) Tj
