(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the operational mechanisms, circuit topology, and calibration of High-Speed Logic Analyzers, detailing asynchronous timing vs synchronous state acquisition and bus protocol decoding.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Core Architecture of a Logic Analyzer:) Tj
T*
(   - Multi-Channel Probing: Logic analyzers provide simultaneous acquisition across 16, 32, 64, or) Tj
T*
(   128 digital channels, connecting to microprocessors, memory buses, or FPGA debugging headers.) Tj
T*
(   - High-Speed Input Comparators: Adjustable threshold comparators convert incoming multi-level) Tj
T*
(   logic voltages \(e.g. 1.2V, 1.8V, 3.3V, 5.0V CMOS/TTL\) into pure binary 1s and 0s.) Tj
T*
(   - Deep Circular Sample Memory: High-speed internal memory buffers record digital states) Tj
T*
(   continuously until a user-defined trigger event occurs, freezing the buffer and displaying) Tj
T*
(   pre-trigger and post-trigger history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Two Acquisition Modes:) Tj
T*
(   - Asynchronous Timing Analysis Mode: Uses the logic analyzer's internal independent high-speed) Tj
T*
(   sampling clock \(e.g. 500 MHz to 2 GHz\). Captures real-time physical edge transitions, timing) Tj
T*
(   delays, pulse widths, and glitch anomalies across channels.) Tj
T*
(   - Synchronous State Analysis Mode: Uses the target circuit's own clock signal \(e.g. posedge) Tj
T*
(   CLK\) to sample data pins. Captures purely valid functional bus states exactly as the receiving) Tj
T*
(   hardware flip-flops see them, ideal for tracing instruction execution and finite state machine) Tj
T*
(   transitions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Protocol Decoding and Packet Disassembly:) Tj
T*
(   - Integrated Hardware/Software Decoders: Automatically analyze raw logic channel transitions) Tj
T*
(   and decode them into human-readable bus packets: decoding I2C \(Start, Address, Read/Write, Ack,) Tj
T*
(   Data, Stop\), SPI \(MOSI/MISO words\), UART, CAN, and PCIe transactions, color-coding fields) Tj
T*
(   directly on the timeline.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
