(   monitoring while both main CPU cores are asleep in Deep Sleep mode, consuming only ~10) Tj
T*
(   micro-amperes.) Tj
T*
(   - Internal Memory: 520 KB on-chip SRAM, 448 KB ROM \(bootloader and core routines\), and external) Tj
T*
(   QSPI Flash/PSRAM support \(up to 16 MB\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Dual-Core FreeRTOS Integration:) Tj
T*
(   - The ESP-IDF \(Espressif IoT Development Framework\) runs a custom SMP \(Symmetric) Tj
T*
(   Multiprocessing\) version of FreeRTOS.) Tj
T*
(   - Dedicated Core Pinning: Engineers can pin specific tasks to specific cores using) Tj
T*
(   `xTaskCreatePinnedToCore\(\)`: assigning heavy networking protocol stacks \(Wi-Fi/TCP-IP/TLS\) to) Tj
T*
(   Core 0 while reserving Core 1 strictly for deterministic real-time sensor sampling, motor) Tj
T*
(   control, or display updates.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Wireless Communications Subsystems:) Tj
T*
(   - 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi: Supports 802.11 b/g/n \(up to 150 Mbps\), supporting Station \(STA\), Access Point) Tj
T*
(   \(AP\), and Wi-Fi Direct modes.) Tj
T*
(   - Bluetooth Subsystem: Integrates both Bluetooth Classic \(BR/EDR for audio\) and Bluetooth Low) Tj
T*
(   Energy \(BLE 4.2 / 5.0\) supporting GATT client/server profiles, beacons, and BLE Mesh networks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
