T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Democratization of Hardware Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - Historically, designing and manufacturing an integrated circuit or complex electronic product) Tj
T*
(   required access to multi-million dollar proprietary EDA software licenses, enterprise server) Tj
T*
(   clusters, and deep corporate financing. The Open-Source Hardware movement has dismantled these) Tj
T*
(   barriers, empowering independent engineers and student inventors to design world-class) Tj
T*
(   electronics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
