T*
(   learner into an active participant in the global technological community.) Tj
T*
(   - Global Technical Society Specializations: IEEE offers specialized societies directly aligned) Tj
T*
(   with ECE pillars: IEEE Solid-State Circuits Society \(SSCS\), IEEE Communications Society) Tj
T*
(   \(ComSoc\), IEEE Electron Devices Society \(EDS\), and IEEE Microwave Theory & Technology Society) Tj
T*
(   \(MTT-S\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Tangible Academic and Networking Benefits:) Tj
T*
(   - Access to Premier Literature: Access to the IEEE Xplore digital library, the world's most) Tj
